$\norm{\vect{x}}$, $\abs{x}$ & Euclidean norm, absolute value & --\\
$\E[x]$, $\Var(x)$, $\Cov(x,y)$ & expectation, variance, covariance & --\\
$\Normal(\vect{\mu},\mat{\Sigma})$ & Gaussian distribution & --\\
